[{"id":"gr-01","title":"Personal Pronouns","titleFa":"ضمایر شخصی","order":1,"emoji":"👤","level":"zero","content":{"explanation":"ضمیر کلمه‌ای است که جای اسم آدم یا چیز را می‌گیرد. ضمایر شخصی فاعلی انگلیسی این‌ها هستند: I، you، he، she، it، we، they. «he» برای مرد، «she» برای زن و «it» برای چیزها و حیوانات به کار می‌رود. در انگلیسی همیشه باید فاعل را بگوییم؛ ضمیر را نمی‌توان حذف کرد.","structure":"فاعل (I / you / he / she / it / we / they) + فعل + بقیه جمله","tipFa":"در فارسی فعل خودش فاعل را نشان می‌دهد (رفتم، رفتیم)، اما در انگلیسی همیشه باید ضمیر یا اسم را بگویید؛ فقط گفتن «went» درست نیست.","examples":[{"en":"I am a student.","fa":"من دانش‌آموز هستم."},{"en":"You are my friend.","fa":"تو دوست من هستی."},{"en":"He is a teacher.","fa":"او (مرد) معلم است."},{"en":"It is a big dog.","fa":"آن یک سگ بزرگ است."},{"en":"They live in Tehran.","fa":"آن‌ها در تهران زندگی می‌کنند."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"___ is my sister.","promptFa":"___ خواهر من است.","options":["He","She","It","We"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Ali and I are friends. ___ are classmates.","promptFa":"علی و من دوستیم. ___ همکلاسی هستیم.","options":["They","We","You","He"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The cat is cute. ___ is small.","promptFa":"گربه بامزه است. ___ کوچک است.","options":["He","She","It","They"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"My parents are here. ___ are happy.","promptFa":"پدر و مادرم اینجا هستند. ___ خوشحال‌اند.","options":["We","They","He","It"],"answer":1}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Which pronoun is for a man?","promptFa":"کدام ضمیر برای یک مرد است؟","options":["She","He","It","They"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Sara and Tom: ___ are students.","promptFa":"سارا و تام: ___ دانش‌آموز هستند.","options":["He","She","They","It"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"My book: ___ is new.","promptFa":"کتاب من: ___ نو است.","options":["It","They","We","He"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which sentence is correct?","promptFa":"کدام جمله درست است؟","options":["Me am a boy.","I am a boy.","I is a boy.","I are a boy."],"answer":1}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"من یک دانش‌آموز هستم.","words":["am","I","a","student"],"answer":["I","am","a","student"]},{"fa":"او (زن) معلم است.","words":["is","teacher","She","a"],"answer":["She","is","a","teacher"]},{"fa":"ما در تهران زندگی می‌کنیم.","words":["We","in","live","Tehran"],"answer":["We","live","in","Tehran"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"___ is my father.","promptFa":"___ پدر من است.","options":["He","She","It","They"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"We are students. ___ are happy.","promptFa":"ما دانش‌آموزیم. ___ خوشحالیم.","options":["It","He","We","She"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"The dog is black. ___ has a tail.","promptFa":"سگ سیاه است. ___ دم دارد.","options":["He","It","They","We"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which pronoun means «آن‌ها»?","promptFa":"کدام ضمیر «آن‌ها» است؟","options":["They","We","You","He"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Sara and Ali: ___ are friends.","promptFa":"سارا و علی: ___ دوست هستند.","options":["She","He","They","It"],"answer":2}]}},{"id":"gr-02","title":"Verb to Be","titleFa":"فعل بودن (am / is / are)","order":2,"emoji":"🟢","level":"zero","content":{"explanation":"فعل «be» یعنی «بودن». بسته به فاعل سه شکل دارد: am برای I، is برای he/she/it و are برای you/we/they. این فعل نقش «هستم، هستی، است» در فارسی را بازی می‌کند. در جمله منفی، not بعد از آن می‌آید.","structure":"فاعل + am/is/are + مکمل (اسم، صفت یا مکان)","tipFa":"در فارسی می‌توانیم «او معلمه» بگوییم و فعل را پنهان کنیم، اما در انگلیسی حذف am/is/are غلط است؛ همیشه باید فعل be در جمله باشد.","examples":[{"en":"I am happy.","fa":"من خوشحالم."},{"en":"You are tall.","fa":"تو قدبلند هستی."},{"en":"He is at home.","fa":"او (مرد) خانه است."},{"en":"She is my mother.","fa":"او (زن) مادر من است."},{"en":"They are students.","fa":"آن‌ها دانش‌آموز هستند."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"I ___ a boy.","promptFa":"من پسر هستم.","options":["am","is","are"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"She ___ my friend.","promptFa":"او (زن) دوست من است.","options":["are","is","am"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"We ___ in the class.","promptFa":"ما در کلاس هستیم.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"It ___ a cat.","promptFa":"آن یک گربه است.","options":["are","is","am"],"answer":1}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Which one is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["They is here.","They are here.","They am here.","They be here."],"answer":1},{"prompt":"You ___ very kind.","promptFa":"تو خیلی مهربانی.","options":["is","am","are","be"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"What is the short form of «She is»?","promptFa":"شکل کوتاه «She is» چیست؟","options":["Shes","She's","Shis","She as"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Negative of «I am happy» is:","promptFa":"منفی جمله «I am happy» کدام است؟","options":["I am not happy.","I not am happy.","I amn't happy.","I not happy."],"answer":0}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"من خوشحال هستم.","words":["happy","I","am"],"answer":["I","am","happy"]},{"fa":"او (مرد) در خانه است.","words":["is","He","home","at"],"answer":["He","is","at","home"]},{"fa":"آن‌ها معلم هستند.","words":["are","teachers","They"],"answer":["They","are","teachers"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"I ___ ten years old.","promptFa":"من ده سالم است.","options":["am","is","are","be"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"My parents ___ teachers.","promptFa":"پدر و مادرم معلم هستند.","options":["is","am","are","be"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"She ___ not at home.","promptFa":"او (زن) خانه نیست.","options":["are","am","is","be"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"Short form of «We are»:","promptFa":"فرم کوتاه «We are» چیست؟","options":["We're","Weer","We s","We are not"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["The sky is blue.","The sky am blue.","The sky are blue.","The sky be blue."],"answer":0}]}},{"id":"gr-03","title":"Positive, Negative and Question","titleFa":"جمله مثبت، منفی و سوالی","order":3,"emoji":"💬","level":"zero","content":{"explanation":"جمله مثبت خبر می‌دهد: She is sad. برای منفی کردن، not را بعد از فعل be می‌گذاریم: She is not sad. برای سوالی کردن، فعل be را به اول جمله می‌بریم: Is she sad? جواب هم با بله یا خیر می‌دهیم: Yes, she is.","structure":"مثبت: فاعل + be + ... | منفی: فاعل + be + not + ... | سؤال: Be + فاعل + ... ؟","tipFa":"در فارسی برای سؤال فقط صدایمان را بلند می‌کنیم (او معلمه؟)، اما در انگلیسی باید فعل را به اول جمله ببریم: Is he a teacher?","examples":[{"en":"She is happy.","fa":"او (زن) خوشحال است."},{"en":"She is not happy.","fa":"او (زن) خوشحال نیست."},{"en":"Is she happy?","fa":"آیا او خوشحال است؟"},{"en":"I am not a teacher.","fa":"من معلم نیستم."},{"en":"Are you ready?","fa":"آیا تو آماده‌ای؟"}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"___ you a student?","promptFa":"آیا تو دانش‌آموز هستی؟","options":["Is","Are","Am"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"He ___ not at school today.","promptFa":"او (مرد) امروز در مدرسه نیست.","options":["are","is","am"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"___ it cold outside?","promptFa":"بیرون سرد است؟","options":["Are","Is","Am"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"I ___ not hungry.","promptFa":"من گرسنه نیستم.","options":["is","are","am"],"answer":2}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Question of «She is a doctor» is:","promptFa":"صورت سوالی این جمله کدام است؟","options":["Is she a doctor?","She is a doctor?","Does she a doctor?","She a doctor is?"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Negative of «They are old»:","promptFa":"منفی این جمله کدام است؟","options":["They are not old.","They not are old.","They is not old.","They are no old."],"answer":0},{"prompt":"«Is he your brother?» — «___»","promptFa":"جواب درست کدام است؟","options":["Yes, he is.","Yes, he are.","Yes, is he.","Yes, he isn't."],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which is a negative sentence?","promptFa":"کدام جمله منفی است؟","options":["I am tired.","I am not tired.","Am I tired?","Tired I am."],"answer":1}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"آیا تو معلم هستی؟","words":["teacher","Are","you","a"],"answer":["Are","you","a","teacher"]},{"fa":"من گرسنه نیستم.","words":["not","I","hungry","am"],"answer":["I","am","not","hungry"]},{"fa":"او (زن) خوشحال نیست.","words":["is","She","happy","not"],"answer":["She","is","not","happy"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"___ she your sister?","promptFa":"آیا او خواهر تو است؟","options":["Are","Is","Am","Do"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Negative of «It is big»:","promptFa":"منفی «It is big» کدام است؟","options":["It is not big.","It not is big.","It is no big.","It not big."],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Question of «You are ready»:","promptFa":"صورت سوالی «You are ready» چیست؟","options":["Are you ready?","You are ready?","Ready you are?","Do you ready?"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"«Is it cold?» — «No, ___»","promptFa":"جواب درست کدام است؟","options":["it isn't","it is","it are","it not"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which sentence is a question?","promptFa":"کدام جمله سوالی است؟","options":["I am late.","You are late.","Am I late?","I am not late."],"answer":2}]}},{"id":"gr-04","title":"Articles: a / an / the","titleFa":"حروف تعریف a / an / the","order":4,"emoji":"📌","level":"zero","content":{"explanation":"«a» و «an» یعنی «یک» و برای اسم مفرد ناشناخته به کار می‌روند. قبل از حرف صدادار (a، e، i، o، u) از «an» استفاده می‌کنیم: an apple. «the» برای چیزی به کار می‌رود که مشخص و شناخته‌شده است: the sun.","structure":"a/an + اسم مفرد | the + اسم مشخص","tipFa":"در فارسی معمولاً «یک» را نمی‌گوییم (کتاب خریدم)، اما در انگلیسی برای یک چیز عام باید a/an بیاید: I bought a book. بعد از a/an هرگز اسم جمع نمی‌آید.","examples":[{"en":"I have a car.","fa":"من یک ماشین دارم."},{"en":"She eats an apple.","fa":"او (زن) یک سیب می‌خورد."},{"en":"The sun is hot.","fa":"خورشید گرم است."},{"en":"This is an old house.","fa":"این یک خانه قدیمی است."},{"en":"The cat is on the table.","fa":"گربه روی میز است."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"I see ___ elephant.","promptFa":"من یک فیل می‌بینم.","options":["a","an","the"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"She has ___ red bag.","promptFa":"او (زن) یک کیف قرمز دارد.","options":["an","a","the"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"___ moon is beautiful tonight.","promptFa":"امشب ماه زیباست.","options":["A","An","The"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"He is ___ good boy.","promptFa":"او (مرد) پسر خوبی است.","options":["an","a","the"],"answer":1}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"We say ___ apple.","promptFa":"می‌گوییم ___ سیب.","options":["a","an","the","of"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["I am a student.","I am an student.","I am the student new.","I am student."],"answer":0},{"prompt":"I need ___ umbrella.","promptFa":"من به یک چتر احتیاج دارم.","options":["a","an","the","of"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Look at ___ sky!","promptFa":"به آسمان نگاه کن!","options":["a","an","the","this a"],"answer":2}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"او (مرد) یک دکتر است.","words":["He","doctor","is","a"],"answer":["He","is","a","doctor"]},{"fa":"این یک سیب قرمز است.","words":["a","This","red","apple","is"],"answer":["This","is","a","red","apple"]},{"fa":"خورشید بزرگ است.","words":["sun","The","is","big"],"answer":["The","sun","is","big"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"She is ___ engineer.","promptFa":"او (زن) مهندس است.","options":["an","a","the","of"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"I have ___ umbrella.","promptFa":"من یک چتر دارم.","options":["a","an","the","some"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"___ earth goes around the sun.","promptFa":"زمین دور خورشید می‌چرخد.","options":["A","An","The","This"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟ (یک ساعت)","options":["an hour","a hour","the hour a","hour an"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"He is ___ best student.","promptFa":"او بهترین دانش‌آموز است.","options":["the","a","an","of"],"answer":0}]}},{"id":"gr-05","title":"Plural Nouns","titleFa":"اسمای جمع","order":5,"emoji":"🐘","level":"zero","content":{"explanation":"برای جمع کردن بیشتر اسم‌ها، «s» به آخر اسم اضافه می‌کنیم: book → books. اگر اسم به s، sh، ch، x یا o ختم شود، «es» می‌گیرد: bus → buses. بعضی اسم‌ها بی‌قاعده‌اند: man → men و child → children.","structure":"اسم مفرد + s/es = اسم جمع","tipFa":"در فارسی «ها/ان» می‌گذاریم ولی در انگلیسی s می‌گذاریم. یادت باشد بعد از a/an اسم جمع نمی‌آید؛ «a books» غلط است.","examples":[{"en":"I have two books.","fa":"من دو کتاب دارم."},{"en":"There are three cats in the yard.","fa":"سه گربه در حیاط است."},{"en":"The buses are red.","fa":"اتوبوس‌ها قرمز هستند."},{"en":"These children are playing.","fa":"این بچه‌ها دارند بازی می‌کنند."},{"en":"Five men work here.","fa":"پنج مرد اینجا کار می‌کنند."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"one dog, two ___","promptFa":"یک سگ، دو ___","options":["dogs","doges","dog"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"one box, three ___","promptFa":"یک جعبه، سه ___","options":["boxs","boxes","box"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"one child, many ___","promptFa":"یک بچه، خیلی ___","options":["childs","children","childrens"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"one man, two ___","promptFa":"یک مرد، دو ___","options":["mens","mans","men"],"answer":2}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Plural of «tomato» is:","promptFa":"جمع «tomato» چیست؟","options":["tomatoes","tomatos","tomatoe","tomato's"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which word is plural?","promptFa":"کدام کلمه جمع است؟","options":["woman","women","womans","womens"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"I have ten ___.","promptFa":"من ده ___ دارم.","options":["finger","fingers","fingeres","fingerss"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["Three student are here.","Three students is here.","Three students are here.","Three student here."],"answer":2}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"من دو کتاب دارم.","words":["I","books","two","have"],"answer":["I","have","two","books"]},{"fa":"گربه‌ها روی میز هستند.","words":["Cats","the","are","on","table"],"answer":["Cats","are","on","the","table"]},{"fa":"بچه‌ها دارند بازی می‌کنند.","words":["children","playing","are","The"],"answer":["The","children","are","playing"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"Plural of «bus»:","promptFa":"جمع «bus» چیست؟","options":["buses","buss","busies","bus's"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Plural of «woman»:","promptFa":"جمع «woman» چیست؟","options":["womans","women","womens","womanes"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"I brush my ___ twice a day.","promptFa":"من روزی دو بار دندان‌هایم را مسواک می‌زنم.","options":["tooths","teeth","tooth","teeths"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"one baby, two ___","promptFa":"یک نوزاد، دو ___","options":["babys","babies","babyes","baby"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["Two cat are here.","Two cats is here.","Two cats are here.","Two cat here is."],"answer":2}]}},{"id":"gr-06","title":"Simple Adjectives","titleFa":"صفت‌های ساده","order":6,"emoji":"🎨","level":"a1","content":{"explanation":"صفت کلمه‌ای است که ویژگی یا حالت را نشان می‌دهد: big، small، happy، cold. در انگلیسی صفت قبل از اسم می‌آید: a big house. اما بعد از فعل be می‌آید: The house is big.","structure":"صفت + اسم | فاعل + be + صفت","tipFa":"در فارسی صفت بعد از اسم می‌آید (خانهٔ بزرگ)، ولی در انگلیسی صفت قبل از اسم می‌آید: a big house. جایشان را عوض نکنید!","examples":[{"en":"She has a small dog.","fa":"او (زن) یک سگ کوچک دارد."},{"en":"The tea is hot.","fa":"چای داغ است."},{"en":"My brother is tall.","fa":"برادر من قدبلند است."},{"en":"It is a beautiful day.","fa":"روز زیبایی است."},{"en":"The box is heavy.","fa":"جعبه سنگین است."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"An elephant is ___.","promptFa":"فیل ___ است.","options":["small","big","new"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Ice is ___.","promptFa":"یخ ___ است.","options":["hot","cold","old"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The sky at night is ___.","promptFa":"آسمان در شب ___ است.","options":["dark","light","noisy"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"A giraffe is very ___.","promptFa":"زرافه خیلی ___ است.","options":["tall","short","slow"],"answer":0}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Which is correct? (a big house)","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟ (یک خانه بزرگ)","options":["a house big","a big house","big a house","a house of big"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The opposite of «big» is:","promptFa":"متضاد «big» چیست؟","options":["small","tall","long","fat"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"This is a ___ flower.","promptFa":"این یک گل ___ است.","options":["beauty","beautiful","beautifully","more beauty"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The coffee is very ___!","promptFa":"قهوه خیلی ___ است!","options":["hotness","hot","hotly","hottest"],"answer":1}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"او (زن) یک ماشین قرمز دارد.","words":["has","She","car","a","red"],"answer":["She","has","a","red","car"]},{"fa":"این یک خانه بزرگ است.","words":["house","This","is","big","a"],"answer":["This","is","a","big","house"]},{"fa":"چای داغ است.","words":["is","The","hot","tea"],"answer":["The","tea","is","hot"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"The opposite of «hot» is:","promptFa":"متضاد «hot» چیست؟","options":["cold","warm","big","new"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"It is a ___ day.","promptFa":"روز آفتابی است.","options":["sun","sunny","sunnily","sunshine"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["She has hair long.","She has long hair.","She has longs hair.","She long has hair."],"answer":1},{"prompt":"A turtle is ___.","promptFa":"لاک‌پشت ___ است.","options":["fast","slow","tall","loud"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The opposite of «small»:","promptFa":"متضاد «small» چیست؟","options":["little","big","tiny","short"],"answer":1}]}},{"id":"gr-07","title":"Possessive Pronouns","titleFa":"ضمایر ملکی","order":7,"emoji":"🔑","level":"a1","content":{"explanation":"برای نشان دادن مالکیت از my، your، his، her، its، our، their استفاده می‌کنیم. این کلمات قبل از اسم می‌آیند: my book، her bag. «his» برای مرد و «her» برای زن است. برای سؤال درباره مالکیت از whose استفاده می‌کنیم.","structure":"ضمیر ملکی (my / your / his / her / its / our / their) + اسم","tipFa":"در فارسی می‌گوییم «کتابِ من» و «من» بعد از اسم می‌آید، اما در انگلیسی ضمیر قبل از اسم می‌آید: my book. فراموش نکنید his برای مرد و her برای زن است.","examples":[{"en":"This is my book.","fa":"این کتاب من است."},{"en":"Her name is Sara.","fa":"اسم او (زن) سارا است."},{"en":"His car is new.","fa":"ماشین او (مرد) نو است."},{"en":"Our school is big.","fa":"مدرسه ما بزرگ است."},{"en":"Their house is near here.","fa":"خانه آن‌ها نزدیک اینجاست."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"I love ___ family.","promptFa":"من به خانواده‌ام علاقه دارم.","options":["my","me","I"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"This is Sara. ___ bag is red.","promptFa":"این ساراست. ___ کیف قرمز است.","options":["His","Her","Their"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Tom lost ___ pen.","promptFa":"تام ___ خودکارش را گم کرد.","options":["her","his","their"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"We clean ___ room every day.","promptFa":"ما هر روز اتاق‌مان را تمیز می‌کنیم.","options":["our","us","we"],"answer":0}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"«The book of Ali» is:","promptFa":"«کتابِ علی» در انگلیسی چیست؟","options":["Ali book","Ali's book","book Ali","the Ali book"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"That is not my pen; it is ___.","promptFa":"آن خودکار من نیست؛ مالِ من است.","options":["mine","my","me","your"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Ali and Reza love ___ mother.","promptFa":"علی و رضا به مادرشان علاقه دارند.","options":["they","them","their","theirs"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["This is mine book.","This is my book.","This is me book.","This my book."],"answer":1}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"این کتاب من است.","words":["my","This","is","book"],"answer":["This","is","my","book"]},{"fa":"خواهر او (زن) دانش‌آموز است.","words":["is","Her","a","sister","student"],"answer":["Her","sister","is","a","student"]},{"fa":"خانه آن‌ها کوچک است.","words":["house","Their","small","is"],"answer":["Their","house","is","small"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"This is ___ sister. (mine)","promptFa":"این خواهر من است.","options":["me","my","mine","I"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Ali washes ___ hands.","promptFa":"علی دست‌هایش را می‌شوید.","options":["his","her","their","your"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"We love ___ school.","promptFa":"ما به مدرسه‌مان علاقه داریم.","options":["us","we","our","ours"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"The red bike is ___. (hers)","promptFa":"دوچرخه قرمز مال او (زن) است.","options":["her","hers","she","her's"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["This is mine pen.","This is my pen.","This is me pen.","This is I pen."],"answer":1}]}},{"id":"gr-08","title":"Present Simple","titleFa":"زمان حال ساده","order":8,"emoji":"🔁","level":"a1","content":{"explanation":"حال ساده برای کارهای همیشگی و عادت‌ها است: I eat breakfast every day. با he، she و it باید «s» به فعل اضافه کنیم: She works. برای منفی و سؤال از do و does کمک می‌گیریم: Do you work? She doesn't work.","structure":"فاعل + فعل (+s با he/she/it) | منفی: don't/doesn't + فعل ساده | سؤال: Do/Does + فاعل + فعل؟","tipFa":"با he/she/it حتماً به فعل s اضافه کنید: «He play» غلط و «He plays» درست است. همچنین بعد از does فعل بدون s می‌آید: Does she play? نه «Does she plays?»","examples":[{"en":"I go to school every day.","fa":"من هر روز به مدرسه می‌روم."},{"en":"She drinks tea in the morning.","fa":"او (زن) صبح‌ها چای می‌نوشد."},{"en":"We live in Shiraz.","fa":"ما در شیراز زندگی می‌کنیم."},{"en":"He doesn't like fish.","fa":"او (مرد) ماهی دوست ندارد."},{"en":"Do you speak English?","fa":"تو انگلیسی صحبت می‌کنی؟"}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"She ___ to music every night.","promptFa":"او (زن) هر شب به موسیقی گوش می‌دهد.","options":["listen","listens","listening"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"I ___ up at 7 o'clock.","promptFa":"من ساعت ۷ بیدار می‌شوم.","options":["gets","get","getting"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"They ___ football on Fridays.","promptFa":"آن‌ها جمعه‌ها فوتبال بازی می‌کنند.","options":["plays","play","playing"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"He ___ not eat meat.","promptFa":"او (مرد) گوشت نمی‌خورد.","options":["do","does","is"],"answer":1}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"___ your father drive a car?","promptFa":"پدرت ماشین می‌راند؟","options":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["He like tea.","He likes tea.","He liking tea.","He to like tea."],"answer":1},{"prompt":"We ___ watch TV at night.","promptFa":"ما شب‌ها تلویزیون تماشا نمی‌کنیم.","options":["doesn't","don't","not","aren't"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Sara ___ her homework every day.","promptFa":"سارا هر روز تکالیفش را انجام می‌دهد.","options":["do","does","doing","did"],"answer":1}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"او (زن) هر روز چای می‌نوشد.","words":["tea","drinks","She","every","day"],"answer":["She","drinks","tea","every","day"]},{"fa":"من ساعت هفت صبحانه می‌خورم.","words":["at","I","breakfast","eat","seven"],"answer":["I","eat","breakfast","at","seven"]},{"fa":"آیا تو فوتبال بازی می‌کنی؟","words":["football","Do","you","play"],"answer":["Do","you","play","football"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"My sister ___ to school by bus.","promptFa":"خواهرم با اتوبوس به مدرسه می‌رود.","options":["go","goes","going","gone"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"___ they live in Tehran?","promptFa":"آیا آن‌ها در تهران زندگی می‌کنند؟","options":["Does","Do","Is","Are"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"He ___ like coffee.","promptFa":"او (مرد) قهوه دوست ندارد.","options":["don't","doesn't","not","isn't"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The sun ___ in the east.","promptFa":"خورشید از مشرق طلوع می‌کند.","options":["rise","rises","rising","risen"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["She play tennis.","She plays tennis.","She playing tennis.","She to play tennis."],"answer":1}]}},{"id":"gr-09","title":"Common Verbs","titleFa":"فعل‌های پرکاربرد","order":9,"emoji":"🏃","level":"a1","content":{"explanation":"فعل‌های پرکاربرد مثل go، eat، drink، see، read، write و play جمله‌های روزمره را می‌سازند. هر فعل معنی خودش را دارد: go یعنی رفتن و eat یعنی خوردن. این فعل‌ها در حال ساده با همه فاعل‌ها به‌جز he/she/it بدون تغییر می‌مانند.","structure":"فاعل + فعل + مکمل","tipFa":"بعضی فعل‌های انگلیسی را حرف‌به‌حرف ترجمه نکنید؛ مثلاً «have breakfast» یعنی صبحانه خوردن، نه «داشتن صبحانه».","examples":[{"en":"I eat breakfast at home.","fa":"من صبحانه را خانه می‌خورم."},{"en":"She reads a book every night.","fa":"او (زن) هر شب کتاب می‌خواند."},{"en":"We buy bread from the shop.","fa":"ما از مغازه نان می‌خریم."},{"en":"They play in the park.","fa":"آن‌ها در پارک بازی می‌کنند."},{"en":"He drinks a lot of water.","fa":"او (مرد) آب زیادی می‌نوشد."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"I ___ tea every morning.","promptFa":"من هر صبح چای می‌نوشم.","options":["drink","eat","read"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"She ___ a letter to her friend.","promptFa":"او (زن) برای دوستش نامه می‌نویسد.","options":["eats","writes","drinks"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"We ___ to school by bus.","promptFa":"ما با اتوبوس به مدرسه می‌رویم.","options":["go","eat","buy"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"He ___ football after school.","promptFa":"او (مرد) بعد از مدرسه فوتبال بازی می‌کند.","options":["reads","plays","drinks"],"answer":1}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Mom ___ dinner for us.","promptFa":"مامان برایمان شام می‌پزد.","options":["cooks","cook","cooking","cooker"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which verb means «خریدن»?","promptFa":"کدام فعل یعنی خریدن؟","options":["buy","see","run","sleep"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"They ___ TV in the evening.","promptFa":"آن‌ها عصرها تلویزیون تماشا می‌کنند.","options":["watch","look","see","read"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["I want water.","I want to water.","I want a water some.","I wanting water."],"answer":0}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"من یک کتاب می‌خوانم.","words":["book","I","a","read"],"answer":["I","read","a","book"]},{"fa":"او (مرد) در پارک می‌دود.","words":["runs","He","the","in","park"],"answer":["He","runs","in","the","park"]},{"fa":"ما از مغازه نان می‌خریم.","words":["bread","buy","We","the","from","shop"],"answer":["We","buy","bread","from","the","shop"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"I ___ my homework every day.","promptFa":"من هر روز تکالیفم را انجام می‌دهم.","options":["do","make","play","eat"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"We ___ bread at the bakery.","promptFa":"ما از نانوایی نان می‌خریم.","options":["buy","see","hear","drink"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"She ___ a song.","promptFa":"او (زن) آواز می‌خواند.","options":["sings","singing","sing to","singed"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which verb means «شنیدن»?","promptFa":"کدام فعل یعنی شنیدن؟","options":["hear","watch","touch","buy"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"They ___ TV after dinner.","promptFa":"آن‌ها بعد از شام تلویزیون تماشا می‌کنند.","options":["watch","look","listen","read"],"answer":0}]}},{"id":"gr-10","title":"Basic Prepositions","titleFa":"حروف اضافه پایه","order":10,"emoji":"📍","level":"a1","content":{"explanation":"حروف اضافه مکان و زمان را نشان می‌دهند: in یعنی داخل، on یعنی روی سطح و under یعنی زیر. برای زمان از at (برای ساعت)، on (برای روز) و in (برای ماه و سال) استفاده می‌کنیم. این کلمه‌های کوچک خیلی مهم‌اند.","structure":"فعل + حرف اضافه (in / on / at / under / to) + اسم یا مکان","tipFa":"در فارسی حرف اضافه بعد از اسم می‌آید (رویِ میز)، ولی در انگلیسی قبل از اسم می‌آید: on the table. همچنین می‌گوییم at school و in Tehran.","examples":[{"en":"The cat is under the table.","fa":"گربه زیر میز است."},{"en":"I am at home.","fa":"من خانه هستم."},{"en":"The book is on the desk.","fa":"کتاب روی میز است."},{"en":"We go to school in the morning.","fa":"ما صبح‌ها به مدرسه می‌رویم."},{"en":"My birthday is in May.","fa":"تولد من در ماه می است."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"The pen is ___ the table.","promptFa":"خودکار ___ میز است.","options":["on","in","at"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"We live ___ Tehran.","promptFa":"ما در تهران زندگی می‌کنیم.","options":["on","in","at"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The cat is ___ the chair. (below)","promptFa":"گربه ___ صندلی است. (زیر)","options":["under","on","in"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"School starts ___ 8 o'clock.","promptFa":"مدرسه ساعت ۸ شروع می‌شود.","options":["in","on","at"],"answer":2}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"I go ___ bed at night.","promptFa":"من شب‌ها به رختخواب می‌روم.","options":["at","to","in","on"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The picture is ___ the wall.","promptFa":"تابلو ___ دیوار است.","options":["on","in","under","at"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"My birthday is ___ July.","promptFa":"تولد من در ماه جولای است.","options":["at","on","in","of"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"He is waiting ___ the bus stop.","promptFa":"او (مرد) در ایستگاه اتوبوس منتظر است.","options":["at","in","on","to"],"answer":0}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"کتاب روی میز است.","words":["is","The","on","book","table","the"],"answer":["The","book","is","on","the","table"]},{"fa":"گربه زیر صندلی است.","words":["The","is","under","cat","the","chair"],"answer":["The","cat","is","under","the","chair"]},{"fa":"من خانه هستم.","words":["I","am","home","at"],"answer":["I","am","at","home"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"The keys are ___ the drawer.","promptFa":"کلیدها داخل کشو هستند.","options":["in","on","at","of"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"I was born ___ spring.","promptFa":"من بهار به دنیا آمدم.","options":["at","on","in","to"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"We have English ___ Monday.","promptFa":"ما روز دوشنبه انگلیسی داریم.","options":["in","at","on","by"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"The picture is ___ the wall.","promptFa":"تابلو روی دیوار است.","options":["on","in","at","under"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"She goes ___ school early.","promptFa":"او (زن) زود به مدرسه می‌رود.","options":["at","to","in","on"],"answer":1}]}},{"id":"gr-11","title":"Question Words","titleFa":"کلمات پرسشی","order":11,"emoji":"❓","level":"a1","content":{"explanation":"برای پرسیدن از کلمه‌های پرسشی استفاده می‌کنیم: What (چه)، Where (کجا)، Who (چه کسی)، When (کی)، Why (چرا) و How (چطور). این کلمه‌ها همیشه اول سؤال می‌آیند: Where do you live?","structure":"کلمه پرسشی + فعل کمکی (do/does/is/are) + فاعل + فعل ؟","tipFa":"در فارسی کلمه پرسشی می‌تواند وسط جمله بیاید (تو کجا زندگی می‌کنی؟)، ولی در انگلیسی همیشه اول جمله می‌آید: Where do you live?","examples":[{"en":"What is your name?","fa":"اسم تو چیست؟"},{"en":"Where do you live?","fa":"کجا زندگی می‌کنی؟"},{"en":"Who is that boy?","fa":"آن پسر چه کسی است؟"},{"en":"When is your birthday?","fa":"تولد تو کی است؟"},{"en":"How are you today?","fa":"امروز چطور حالت است؟"}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"___ is your best friend?","promptFa":"___ بهترین دوست تو است؟","options":["Who","What","Where"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"___ do you go to school? — By bus.","promptFa":"___ به مدرسه می‌روی؟ — با اتوبوس.","options":["When","How","Who"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"___ is my bag? — On the table.","promptFa":"کیف من ___ است؟ — روی میز.","options":["What","Who","Where"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"___ old are you?","promptFa":"چند سالت است؟","options":["What","How","When"],"answer":1}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"«___ are you sad?» — «Because I lost my pen.»","promptFa":"چرا ناراحت هستی؟ — چون خودکارم را گم کردم.","options":["Why","What","Where","Who"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"«___ is your name?» — «Sara.»","promptFa":"اسم تو چیست؟ — سارا.","options":["Who","What","How","When"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"«___ do you wake up?» — «At 6.»","promptFa":"کی بیدار می‌شوی؟ — ساعت ۶.","options":["Where","Who","When","What"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"Which question asks about place?","promptFa":"کدام سؤال درباره مکان است؟","options":["What is this?","Where is the cat?","Who is he?","When do we go?"],"answer":1}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"اسم تو چیست؟","words":["your","What","is","name"],"answer":["What","is","your","name"]},{"fa":"تو کجا زندگی می‌کنی؟","words":["you","Where","live","do"],"answer":["Where","do","you","live"]},{"fa":"او (مرد) کی می‌آید؟","words":["come","When","does","he"],"answer":["When","does","he","come"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"«___ is your teacher?» — «Mrs. Brown.»","promptFa":"معلمت چه کسی است؟ — خانم براون.","options":["Who","What","Where","When"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"«___ do you like winter?» — «Because of snow.»","promptFa":"چرا زمستان را دوست داری؟ — به‌خاطر برف.","options":["What","Why","Who","Where"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"«___ are you from?» — «Iran.»","promptFa":"اهل کجا هستی؟ — ایران.","options":["What","Who","Where","How"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"Which word asks about time?","promptFa":"کدام کلمه درباره زمان می‌پرسد؟","options":["Where","What","When","Who"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"«___ old is your brother?» — «Twelve.»","promptFa":"برادرت چند سالش است؟ — دوازده.","options":["What","How","When","Who"],"answer":1}]}},{"id":"gr-12","title":"There is / There are","titleFa":"وجود داشتن (There is / There are)","order":12,"emoji":"🏠","level":"a1","content":{"explanation":"برای گفتن «وجود داشتن» یک چیز از there is (برای مفرد) و there are (برای جمع) استفاده می‌کنیم. مثلاً There is a cat on the roof یعنی یک گربه روی پشت‌بام است. برای منفی، not اضافه می‌کنیم و برای سؤال، is/are را به اول جمله می‌بریم.","structure":"There is + اسم مفرد | There are + اسم جمع","tipFa":"فارسی‌زبان‌ها معمولاً «هست» را مستقیم ترجمه می‌کنند و می‌گویند It is a cat on the roof؛ درستش There is a cat on the roof است.","examples":[{"en":"There is a book on the table.","fa":"یک کتاب روی میز است."},{"en":"There are many cars in the street.","fa":"ماشین‌های زیادی در خیابان است."},{"en":"There is no milk in the fridge.","fa":"شیری در یخچال نیست."},{"en":"Are there two windows in your room?","fa":"آیا دو پنجره در اتاقت هست؟"},{"en":"There isn't a park near our house.","fa":"پارکی نزدیک خانه ما نیست."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"There ___ a lamp in my room.","promptFa":"یک چراغ در اتاقم است.","options":["are","is","am"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"There ___ five apples on the plate.","promptFa":"پنج سیب در بشقاب است.","options":["is","are","be"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"___ there a doctor here?","promptFa":"آیا دکتری اینجا هست؟","options":["Are","Am","Is"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"There ___ not any water in the glass.","promptFa":"آبی در لیوان نیست.","options":["is","are","be"],"answer":0}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟ (سه صندلی هست)","options":["There is three chairs.","There are three chairs.","There three chairs.","It is three chairs."],"answer":1},{"prompt":"___ there any milk in the fridge?","promptFa":"آیا شیری در یخچال هست؟","options":["Is","Are","Do","Does"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"There ___ a big tree in the yard.","promptFa":"یک درخت بزرگ در حیاط است.","options":["are","is","were","have"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Negative of «There is a dog here»:","promptFa":"منفی این جمله کدام است؟","options":["There is not a dog here.","There not is a dog here.","There are not a dog here.","There is no not dog."],"answer":0}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"یک گربه روی مبل است.","words":["a","There","cat","is","the","on","sofa"],"answer":["There","is","a","cat","on","the","sofa"]},{"fa":"دو پنجره در اتاق هست.","words":["are","windows","There","two","in","the","room"],"answer":["There","are","two","windows","in","the","room"]},{"fa":"شیری در یخچال نیست.","words":["is","milk","There","no","in","the","fridge"],"answer":["There","is","no","milk","in","the","fridge"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"There ___ a zoo in our city.","promptFa":"یک باغ‌وحش در شهر ماست.","options":["are","is","be","have"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"There ___ many stars at night.","promptFa":"شب‌ها ستاره‌های زیادی هستند.","options":["is","are","am","be"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"___ there a bank near here?","promptFa":"آیا بانکی نزدیک اینجاست؟","options":["Are","Is","Do","Have"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"There ___ any juice in the fridge.","promptFa":"هیچ آبمیوه‌ای در یخچال نیست.","options":["isn't","aren't","not is","no is"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["There is two cats outside.","There are two cats outside.","There two cats outside.","It is two cats outside."],"answer":1}]}},{"id":"gr-13","title":"Can and Can't","titleFa":"توانستن (Can و Can't)","order":13,"emoji":"💪","level":"a1","content":{"explanation":"«can» یعنی توانستن و اجازه گرفتن: I can swim. بعد از can همیشه فعل ساده می‌آید و s نمی‌گیرد: She can run. برای منفی می‌گوییم cannot یا can't. برای سؤال، can را به اول جمله می‌آوریم: Can you help me?","structure":"فاعل + can/can't + فعل ساده","tipFa":"بعد از can فعل را با to یا با s نیاورید: «She can to runs» غلط و «She can run» درست است. تلفظ can't هم «کانت» است.","examples":[{"en":"I can ride a bike.","fa":"من می‌توانم دوچرخه‌سواری کنم."},{"en":"She can speak three languages.","fa":"او (زن) می‌تواند سه زبان صحبت کند."},{"en":"We can't come today.","fa":"ما امروز نمی‌توانیم بیاییم."},{"en":"Can you open the window?","fa":"می‌توانی پنجره را باز کنی؟"},{"en":"Birds can fly.","fa":"پرنده‌ها می‌توانند پرواز کنند."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"She ___ swim very well.","promptFa":"او (زن) خیلی خوب می‌تواند شنا کند.","options":["can","cans","to can"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"I ___ not drive a car.","promptFa":"من نمی‌توانم ماشین برانم.","options":["can","am","do"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"___ you help me, please?","promptFa":"می‌توانی لطفاً کمکم کنی؟","options":["Can","Are","Do"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Dogs ___ fly.","promptFa":"سگ‌ها نمی‌توانند پرواز کنند.","options":["can","can't","is"],"answer":1}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["He can plays football.","He can play football.","He can to play football.","He cans play football."],"answer":1},{"prompt":"«Can she dance?» — «Yes, she ___»","promptFa":"جواب درست کدام است؟","options":["can","cans","can she","is"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Negative of «can» is:","promptFa":"منفی «can» چیست؟","options":["can't","don't can","not can","can's"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Babies ___ walk.","promptFa":"نوزادها نمی‌توانند راه بروند.","options":["can","can't","are"],"answer":1}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"من می‌توانم شنا کنم.","words":["I","swim","can"],"answer":["I","can","swim"]},{"fa":"می‌توانی در را باز کنی؟","words":["door","Can","you","open","the"],"answer":["Can","you","open","the","door"]},{"fa":"او (مرد) نمی‌تواند بیاید.","words":["He","come","can't"],"answer":["He","can't","come"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"I ___ speak English.","promptFa":"من می‌توانم انگلیسی صحبت کنم.","options":["can","cans","to can","am can"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"She ___ come today; she is sick.","promptFa":"او (زن) امروز نمی‌تواند بیاید؛ مریض است.","options":["can","can't","cans","is"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"___ I borrow your pen?","promptFa":"می‌توانم خودکارت را قرض بگیرم؟","options":["Can","Am","Does","Is"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"After «can» we use:","promptFa":"بعد از can چه فعل می‌آید؟","options":["verb + s","verb + to","plain verb","verb + ing"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["He can swim fast.","He can to swim fast.","He can swims fast.","He cans swim fast."],"answer":0}]}},{"id":"gr-14","title":"Present Continuous","titleFa":"زمان حال استمراری","order":14,"emoji":"🎬","level":"a2","content":{"explanation":"حال استمراری برای کاری است که همین الان در جریان است: I am eating now. ساختنش آسان است: am/is/are + فعل با ing. برای منفی، not می‌گذاریم و برای سؤال، فعل کمکی را جلو می‌بریم: Is he sleeping?","structure":"فاعل + am/is/are + فعل + ing","tipFa":"در انگلیسی فرق «می‌خورم» و «دارم می‌خورم» مهم است: با now از am eating استفاده کنید نه eat. حرف e آخر بعضی فعل‌ها در حالت ing حذف می‌شود: write → writing.","examples":[{"en":"I am reading a book now.","fa":"من الان دارم کتاب می‌خوانم."},{"en":"She is cooking dinner.","fa":"او (زن) دارد شام می‌پزد."},{"en":"They are playing outside.","fa":"آن‌ها دارند بیرون بازی می‌کنند."},{"en":"We are not watching TV.","fa":"ما نداریم تلویزیون تماشا می‌کنیم."},{"en":"Is it raining?","fa":"آیا باران دارد می‌بارد؟"}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"He ___ a letter now.","promptFa":"او (مرد) الان دارد نامه می‌نویسد.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"I am ___ TV.","promptFa":"من دارم تلویزیون تماشا می‌کنم.","options":["watch","watching","watched"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The children ___ sleeping.","promptFa":"بچه‌ها دارند می‌خوابند.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"She is ___ a cake.","promptFa":"او (زن) دارد کیک درست می‌کند.","options":["makeing","making","makes"],"answer":1}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟ (دارم به مدرسه می‌روم)","options":["I am go to school.","I am going to school.","I going to school.","I am go toing school."],"answer":1},{"prompt":"They ___ football right now.","promptFa":"آن‌ها همین حالا دارند فوتبال بازی می‌کنند.","options":["play","plays","are playing","is playing"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"write → writing, like → ?","promptFa":"«like» در حالت ing چه می‌شود؟","options":["likeing","liking","like toing","likes"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Negative of «Is she crying?» is:","promptFa":"منفی این جمله کدام است؟","options":["She is not crying.","She not is crying.","She are not crying.","She does not crying."],"answer":0}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"من الان دارم کتاب می‌خوانم.","words":["am","I","a","reading","book","now"],"answer":["I","am","reading","a","book","now"]},{"fa":"او (زن) دارد شام می‌پزد.","words":["is","She","cooking","dinner"],"answer":["She","is","cooking","dinner"]},{"fa":"آن‌ها دارند در باغ بازی می‌کنند.","words":["garden","They","playing","are","in","the"],"answer":["They","are","playing","in","the","garden"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"Look! It ___ .","promptFa":"نگاه کن! دارد باران می‌بارد.","options":["rains","is raining","rain","rained"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"I ___ my homework at the moment.","promptFa":"من همین حالا دارم تکالیفم را انجام می‌دهم.","options":["do","am doing","does","did"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"They are ___ in the yard.","promptFa":"آن‌ها دارند در حیاط بازی می‌کنند.","options":["play","plays","playing","played"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"She ___ not listening to music.","promptFa":"او (زن) ندارد به موسیقی گوش می‌دهد.","options":["is","am","are","does"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["I am study now.","I am studying now.","I studying now.","I studies now."],"answer":1}]}},{"id":"gr-15","title":"Past Simple (Basic)","titleFa":"زمان گذشته ساده (پایه)","order":15,"emoji":"🕰️","level":"a2","content":{"explanation":"گذشته ساده برای کاری به کار می‌رود که تمام شده است: I played football yesterday. برای فعل‌های باقاعده، ed اضافه می‌کنیم: watch → watched. فعل‌های بی‌قاعده شکل خودشان را دارند: go → went و eat → ate. منفی و سؤال با did ساخته می‌شود: Did you go? I didn't go.","structure":"فاعل + فعل گذشته (ed یا بی‌قاعده) | منفی: didn't + فعل ساده","tipFa":"بعد از did همیشه فعل ساده می‌آید، نه شکل گذشته: «Did you went?» غلط است. همچنین در جمله گذشته انگلیسی، نشانهٔ گذشته (ed یا فعل بی‌قاعده) حتماً لازم است.","examples":[{"en":"I watched TV last night.","fa":"دیشب تلویزیون تماشا کردم."},{"en":"She visited her grandma on Friday.","fa":"او (زن) جمعه به مادربزرگش سر زد."},{"en":"We went to the park yesterday.","fa":"دیروز به پارک رفتیم."},{"en":"He didn't do his homework.","fa":"او (مرد) تکلیفش را انجام نداد."},{"en":"Did you eat lunch?","fa":"ناهار خوردی؟"}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"I ___ to school yesterday. (go)","promptFa":"دیروز به مدرسه رفتم.","options":["go","went","goes"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"She ___ TV last night. (watch)","promptFa":"او (زن) دیشب تلویزیون تماشا کرد.","options":["watched","watches","watch"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"We ___ pizza for dinner. (eat)","promptFa":"ما برای شام پیتزا خوردیم.","options":["eat","ate","eats"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"He ___ not play outside.","promptFa":"او (مرد) بیرون بازی نکرد.","options":["did","does","was"],"answer":0}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Past of «buy» is:","promptFa":"گذشته «buy» چیست؟","options":["buyed","bought","buys","buying"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["Did you saw him?","Did you see him?","Do you saw him?","Did you seen him?"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"They ___ a movie last week.","promptFa":"آن‌ها هفته پیش فیلم دیدند.","options":["see","saw","sees","seeing"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Negative of «I played» is:","promptFa":"منفی «I played» کدام است؟","options":["I didn't play.","I didn't played.","I not played.","I don't played."],"answer":0}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"دیشب تلویزیون تماشا کردم.","words":["watched","I","last","TV","night"],"answer":["I","watched","TV","last","night"]},{"fa":"او (زن) دیروز به پارک رفت.","words":["yesterday","She","to","went","the","park"],"answer":["She","went","to","the","park","yesterday"]},{"fa":"آیا ناهار خوردی؟","words":["Did","eat","you","lunch"],"answer":["Did","you","eat","lunch"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"Past of «go»:","promptFa":"گذشته «go» چیست؟","options":["goed","went","gone","goes"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Past of «play»:","promptFa":"گذشته «play» چیست؟","options":["playd","plaied","played","plays"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"Yesterday, we ___ to the cinema.","promptFa":"دیروز به سینما رفتیم.","options":["go","goes","went","going"],"answer":2},{"prompt":"She ___ her room last night.","promptFa":"او (زن) دیشب اتاقش را تمیز کرد.","options":["cleans","cleaned","cleaning","clean"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟","options":["Did you called me?","Did you call me?","Do you called me?","Did you calling me?"],"answer":1}]}},{"id":"gr-16","title":"Word Order","titleFa":"ترتیب کلمات در جمله","order":16,"emoji":"🧱","level":"a2","content":{"explanation":"جمله انگلیسی ترتیب ثابتی دارد: اول فاعل، بعد فعل و بعد مکمل: Ali eats an apple. قید مکان و زمان معمولاً آخر جمله می‌آید: I go to school in the morning. صفت هم قبل از اسم می‌آید: a red car.","structure":"فاعل + فعل + مکمل + (مکان) + (زمان)","tipFa":"در فارسی ترتیب جمله انعطاف دارد (به مدرسه رفتم)، ولی در انگلیسی ترتیب ثابت است. یادت باشد زمان در انگلیسی معمولاً بعد از مکان می‌آید: at home now.","examples":[{"en":"Ali eats an apple.","fa":"علی یک سیب می‌خورد."},{"en":"Sara reads books at home.","fa":"سارا خانه کتاب می‌خواند."},{"en":"We play football after school.","fa":"ما بعد از مدرسه فوتبال بازی می‌کنیم."},{"en":"I drink tea in the morning.","fa":"من صبح‌ها چای می‌نوشم."},{"en":"My father drives a blue car.","fa":"پدرم یک ماشین آبی می‌راند."}],"fillBlank":[{"prompt":"___ plays football every Friday.","promptFa":"برادرم هر جمعه فوتبال بازی می‌کند.","options":["My brother","Brother my","My brother he","He my brother"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"My mother ___ every morning.","promptFa":"مادرم هر صبح صبحانه درست می‌کند.","options":["makes breakfast","breakfast makes","is make breakfast","making breakfast"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"___ helped the old man.","promptFa":"پسر مهربان به پیرمرد کمک کرد.","options":["The kind boy","The boy kind","Kind the boy","The boy he kind"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"He puts the book ___ .","promptFa":"او کتاب را روی میز می‌گذارد.","options":["on the table","the table on","table on the","on table the"],"answer":0}],"mcq":[{"prompt":"Which sentence has the correct word order?","promptFa":"کدام جمله ترتیب درست دارد؟","options":["I ate an apple.","An apple ate I.","Ate an apple I.","Apple I ate an."],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Correct order of (coffee / drinks / my father):","promptFa":"ترتیب درست کدام است؟","options":["My father drinks coffee.","Drinks my father coffee.","Coffee my father drinks.","My father coffee drinks."],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Where does the time word usually go?","promptFa":"قید زمان معمولاً کجای جمله می‌آید؟","options":["Before the subject","After the verb and place","Always at the beginning","Anywhere"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Which is correct?","promptFa":"کدام درست است؟ (یک ماشین بزرگ قرمز)","options":["A big red car","A red big car","Red a big car","Big a red car"],"answer":0}],"wordOrder":[{"fa":"پدرم یک ماشین آبی می‌راند.","words":["drives","My","a","father","car","blue"],"answer":["My","father","drives","a","blue","car"]},{"fa":"ما بعد از مدرسه فوتبال بازی می‌کنیم.","words":["play","We","after","football","school"],"answer":["We","play","football","after","school"]},{"fa":"من هر روز صبح چای می‌نوشم.","words":["drink","I","every","tea","morning"],"answer":["I","drink","tea","every","morning"]}],"quiz":[{"prompt":"Correct order:","promptFa":"ترتیب درست کدام است؟","options":["Tea I drink","I drink tea","Drink I tea","I tea drink"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"The subject comes ___ .","promptFa":"فاعل کجای جمله می‌آید؟","options":["after the verb","first","last","anywhere"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Correct order:","promptFa":"ترتیب درست کدام است؟","options":["a car fast","a fast car","fast a car","car a fast"],"answer":1},{"prompt":"Sara ___ every evening.","promptFa":"سارا هر عصر خانه کتاب می‌خواند.","options":["reads a book at home","at home reads a book","a book reads at home","at home a book reads"],"answer":0},{"prompt":"Which sentence is correct?","promptFa":"کدام جمله درست است؟","options":["In Tehran live I.","I live in Tehran.